# graphify corpus exclusions (gitignore syntax; graphify does NOT read .gitignore).
# Keeps the knowledge graph focused on source + design docs.

# The committed graph snapshot itself. It lists node and community names, so
# indexing it makes graphify generate nodes about its own prior output —
# self-referential churn that inflated every snapshot refresh.
docs/graph-report.md

# In-tree CMake build directories and vendored dependency trees. graphify
# scans these unless excluded here, pulling googletest/spdlog/tomlplusplus and
# build artifacts into the graph. Listing them lets `graphify update .` run
# clean without moving these dirs out of the tree first.
build*/
_deps/
